/* Gamestage fonts: DM Sans (interface text) and Unbounded (numbers a player
   tracks: score, timer, rank, multiplier, level).

   Self-hosted. Nothing here reaches a third-party origin, and that is the
   point rather than a detail: `@import url("https://fonts.googleapis.com/…")`
   sent every player's IP address to Google on page load, before any consent
   gate could run, and a German court has ruled on that pattern. It stopped a
   prize draw in four territories (GSUI-149). BDS-005 chose to link rather than
   self-host, weighing one line against a licence question and roughly 300KB;
   the licence question has an answer, and this is the other side of that
   decision.

   Both faces are under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, which permits
   redistributing the files with the licence beside them. The licence texts,
   the versions and where each file came from are in gamestage-fonts/README.md.

   The files are the latin subset, so western Europe is covered and Polish,
   Czech, Turkish and Vietnamese are not. Adding latin-ext is a decision in
   that README rather than a set of files carried in advance.

   Import this once at the root, before gamestage-tokens.css, so the family
   names tokens.css declares are already loaded. The url() paths are relative
   to this stylesheet, and the registry ships the files to the directory beside
   it, so the same paths resolve here and in a customer's app.

   No preconnect hint is needed any more. The faces come from the origin the
   page is already on. */

@font-face {
  font-family: 'DM Sans';
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 400 900;
  font-display: swap;
  src: url('./gamestage-fonts/dm-sans-latin.woff2') format('woff2');
  unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA,
    U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193,
    U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
}

@font-face {
  font-family: 'Unbounded';
  font-style: normal;
  font-weight: 500 900;
  font-display: swap;
  src: url('./gamestage-fonts/unbounded-latin.woff2') format('woff2');
  unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA,
    U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193,
    U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
}
